                                        "entry_id": "78ca8d56-096f-331e-814b-196404c36d5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One's exclusive romantic partner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "38705aae-54f1-401f-8e95-e164a6007934",
                                                "sense_id": "99395ec5-c88a-3395-9d1b-4ce821dc69f9",
                                                "text": "Almost half of working women who are married or live with a partner are seeing their significant other only in passing because the two work different shifts, an AFL-CIO poll found."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cb82e24-1a57-4b53-8f74-b6eaa143038c",
                                                "sense_id": "99395ec5-c88a-3395-9d1b-4ce821dc69f9",
                                                "text": "More than half (57 percent) of consumers think it would be wonderfully romantic if their significant other booked tickets for a surprise international trip."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a50a90aa-cd30-3db4-a1a9-adc196d6875f",
                                        "entry_id": "78ca8d56-096f-331e-814b-196404c36d5f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person with whom one has an important bond of some kind."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "192263db-e1a7-4978-9dc9-5c99f1fa47f2",
                                                "sense_id": "a50a90aa-cd30-3db4-a1a9-adc196d6875f",
                                                "text": "Dr. Nogueira said it was always preferable to have coaches drawn from a school's staff because a coach \"is a significant other\" to a student."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "667af7da-05a5-4c2b-b9f7-fd455cd261ac",
                                                "sense_id": "a50a90aa-cd30-3db4-a1a9-adc196d6875f",
                                                "text": "As in the rest of the hospital, a family member or \"significant other\" such as a lover or close friend, is allowed to spend the night in a patient's room on a cot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6df27b29-623a-4c2a-8115-633e8eb7d578",
                                                "sense_id": "a50a90aa-cd30-3db4-a1a9-adc196d6875f",
                                                "text": "If your spouse, children or other significant others are still whining about all those holiday leftovers you made them eat, maybe it's time to spruce up your culinary skills."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
